          "message": {
            "text": "UAX #50 mixed-orientation classification is now a browser-serializable pure stage rather than factory-local state. Moving the immutable range table out of each handler construction also avoids rebuilding it per capture; focused boundary tests and a real Chromium capture E2E remain green.",
            "markdown": "UAX #50 mixed-orientation classification is now a browser-serializable pure stage rather than factory-local state. Moving the immutable range table out of each handler construction also avoids rebuilding it per capture; focused boundary tests and a real Chromium capture E2E remain green."
          },
